@startuml
!include amp-style.puml

title AMP Container Component Overview

top to bottom direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam linetype ortho

component "External application /\nservice" as External
interface "Perception" as IPerception

rectangle "AMP Development Forge Container" {
  package "AMP element chain" as CHAIN {
    component "ampinfer" as AMPINFER
    component "amptracker" as AMPTRACKER
    component "ampperformance" as AMPPERF
    component "amposd" as AMPOSD
    component "ampsink" as AMPSINK
  }

  package "Inference execution inside ampinfer" as INFERBOX {
    component "OpChain / Op system\n(JSON descriptors,\nconfigure -> bind -> process,\nloopId-based execution)" as OPC
    component "Preprocess Ops" as PRE
    component "Inference Ops\n(ONNX / Hailo / ExecuTorch)" as INF
    component "Postprocess Parsers" as POST
  }

  package "Stable runtime contract" as CONTRACT {
    component "PerceptionMeta /\nPerception" as PERC
    component "PerceptionSerializer /\npublisher boundary" as PERCSER
  }

  package "Current pipeline host layer" as HOST {
    component "GStreamer runtime\n(current media transport,\nscheduling, and metadata carrier)" as GST
  }
}

AMPINFER -down-> AMPTRACKER
AMPTRACKER -down-> AMPPERF
AMPPERF -down-> AMPOSD
AMPOSD -down-> AMPSINK

OPC -down-> PRE
PRE -down-> INF
INF -down-> POST
OPC ..> AMPINFER : executes inside

CHAIN --> PERC

PERC -down-> PERCSER
PERCSER -down-> IPerception
IPerception -down-> External

GST -up-> CHAIN

INFERBOX -[hidden]right-> CHAIN
CHAIN -[hidden]right-> CONTRACT
CHAIN -[hidden]down-> HOST
INFERBOX -[hidden]down-> HOST
CONTRACT -[hidden]down-> HOST
CONTRACT -[hidden]down-> IPerception
IPerception -[hidden]down-> External

legend bottom
- GStreamer is the current pipeline/orchestration host layer.
  It handles media transport, scheduling, and metadata carriage.
- OpChain is the inference-specific glue inside ampinfer.
  It binds preprocess, backend execution, and postprocess stages.
- Perception is the stable runtime contract passed between AMP components
  and published to external applications.
- ampinfer creates and enriches that contract via OpChain execution.
- amptracker and ampperformance append more structured runtime data.
- amposd and ampsink consume it for rendering and publication.
endlegend

@enduml
